        "TileImage": "$($repository 6e5c017a-a08f-4dbb-97d4-a384c9057475).Image",
        "Description": "This mission will be a tricky one, 47.  After a money laundering scanal gone wrong within the interworkings of Sanguine, many employs at the near by Sanguine Fashion store are on high alert with no intel other than stay alive. You, 47, are to change that notion for good. Prevent a bounce back from one of providences leading operations, and dismantle the inner-cogs of the machine, One by One. I leave you to prepare.",
